# Restored after this checkout's "squash upload" dropped it again — see
# CHANGELOG.md ("Restoring .github/workflows/ and .gitignore after the
# squash upload") and docs/archive/GAPS_2026-09.md item 6. Without this
# file every `git add -A` re-commits build caches, the WinDivert driver
# binaries, and local runtime state that can contain your relay server's
# IP address.

# Rust build output / IDE build-check cache (rust-analyzer flycheck, etc).
target/
**/target/

# WinDivert redistributables — fetched at build time with a pinned SHA-256
# by scripts/fetch-windivert.ps1 / scripts/fetch-windivert.sh (see README
# and build-windows.bat). Never commit the binaries themselves.
*.dll
*.lib
*.sys
*.exe

# Local runtime state written next to the built binary — may contain the
# relay server's IP/address (see src/dns_cache.rs, src/observability.rs).
dpi_guard.toml
dpi_guard.dns_cache
dpi_guard.proxy_state
dpi_guard.instance.lock
*.toml.stop

# dpi_guard.toml.example is the tracked template read via
# CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR (src/config.rs) — keep it even though *.toml-ish
# runtime files above are ignored.
!dpi_guard.toml.example

# Node/jsdom test tooling (uitest/).
node_modules/
uitest/node_modules/

# Misc OS/editor cruft and archives that should never be committed wholesale.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.zip
*.tar.gz
